h:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/donamortashhhmotelonda/img_0615.jpg\" alt=\"img_0615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
